It''s a great story, beautifully presented and acted. Also the Balkan setting speaks to my Slavic soul. You know, I feel this wonderful familiarity. 

Definitely one of the movies I think quite often and my golden standard when it comes to folk horrors, I always compare other movies to You Won''t Be Alone (feelings and impressions they leave me with).', NULL, 0, '2026-08-08 02:23:49', 1);
